# The image (Dockerfile) carries the server, the client, the library and each tile's client rasters and JSON layers;
# the pipeline's intermediates (terrain, vegetation, imagery, seasons, the cache, the unreal export) stay out, as do
# the workstation's own things.
.git
.github
.venv
.claude
.env
.env.*
data
scratch
docs
tools
tests
node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
tiles/*/terrain
tiles/*/vegetation
tiles/*/imagery
tiles/*/seasons
tiles/*/_cache
tiles/*/unreal
tiles/*/lidar
tiles/*/game
tiles/*/footprint/*.tif
tiles/*/footprint/mask.geojson
# the pipeline's shared download caches (Sentinel-2 composites alone reached 6.8 GB with the world probes, 2026-11-06,
# and pushed the image past what the machine would take); the server reads none of them
pipeline/_cache/sentinel
